{"id": null, "n": "0076005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0076005", "type": "orig", "text": "惛＝昏【三】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0076006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0076006", "type": "orig", "text": "（（展轉…決定））十字＝（（定展轉增上力二識成決））十字【元】"}
